,{\"className\":\"mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300\",\"children\":\"Canva is built for visual design and templates. Focused image utilities are built to complete a narrow technical task quickly, such as resizing, converting or removing metadata.\"}],[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 space-y-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"Canva and focused image utilities solve different parts of a visual workflow. Canva is a broad design environment for arranging text, images and templates. A utility such as a cropper, compressor or format converter is designed to complete one technical file operation with fewer steps.\",{\"children\":\"Canva and focused image utilities solve different parts of a visual workflow. Canva is a broad design environment for arranging text, images and templates. A utility such as a cropper, compressor or format converter is designed to complete one technical file operation with fewer steps.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"The practical choice is not necessarily one or the other. A browser utility can prepare an asset before design work or optimize the exported image afterwards.\",{\"children\":\"The practical choice is not necessarily one or the other. A browser utility can prepare an asset before design work or optimize the exported image afterwards.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl font-black\",\"children\":\"Practical comparison\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-white/10\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full min-w-[720px] border-collapse text-left\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-slate-900\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"Decision point\",{\"className\":\"p-4 text-slate-200\",\"children\":\"Decision point\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"Canva or a design suite\",{\"className\":\"p-4 text-slate-200\",\"